            "description": {
              "content": "Loads a community visualization into a Looker Studio report. The visualization is identified by its manifest URL hosted on Google Cloud Storage. Looker Studio fetches the manifest, resolves the JavaScript and CSS resources, and renders the visualization with the report's data.",
